<title>POLAND: ING Barings rates Unibud as &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>ING Barings rates Unibud as &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings rated Polish construction company Unibud SA as &quot;buy&quot; in its report dated May 31, forecasting its value could increase to 45 zlotys a share within the next three to six months.</p>
<p>&quot;Our target price of 45 zlotys implies 40 percent upside over the next three-six months,&quot; the report said.</p>
<p>Unibud, which traded at 28.2 zloty on May 31, increased to 37 zlotys on Friday.</p>
<p>The report also forecast Unibud's net profit would double in 1997 to 4.9 million, compared with 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
